1. Self-built materials (this repository's original work)

   The following original materials created for this benchmark are
   released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
   License (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/):

     - the unified record schema, record IDs, split assignments and
       selection/audit metadata (schema.json, dataset_card.json,
       audit fields in data/*.jsonl, splits/*.jsonl);
     - the build, validation and evaluation scripts (scripts/);
     - the review CSV, documentation and this rights statement.

2. Upstream materials (NOT covered by the license above)

   This benchmark redistributes or references content from upstream
   projects. Those materials remain under their original terms, and the
   CC BY 4.0 grant above does NOT apply to them:

     - HL Dataset: annotations under Apache-2.0; images and object
       descriptions remain subject to the original MS COCO terms.
       https://github.com/michelecafagna26/HL-dataset
     - HSSBench: the official repository provides no standalone LICENSE;
       confirm redistribution permission with the authors before
       republication. https://github.com/Zhaolu-K/HSSBench
     - MM-MoralBench: images originate from the authors' publicly
       provided image archive; the official repository provides no
       standalone LICENSE; confirm before republication.
       https://github.com/BeiiiY/MM-MoralBench
     - VULCA-Bench: benchmark metadata, critiques and tools under
       CC BY 4.0; third-party artwork images are NOT redistributed by
       this repository (only original references are retained).
       https://github.com/vulca-org/vulca-cultural-visual-benchmark
     - ValueGround: paper/repository reference only; no data
       redistributed. https://github.com/NL2G/ValueGround

   Per-record rights notes and source URLs are preserved in
   source_snapshots/selected_source_records.jsonl and references/.

3. Attribution

   When using this benchmark, please cite the upstream sources above as
   well as this repository.
